{"id":963397,"title":"06｜生态集成：如何接入微信和飞书?","content":"<p><img src=\"https://static001.geekbang.org/resource/image/e2/1c/e23031bb8d720byyceb3e8b517dc6f1c.png?wh=720x402\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>各位“养虾”朋友们，相信这只“龙虾”已经生活在你的电脑里了。</p>\n<p>但是要让它真正成为你的数字员工，最关键的一步就是<strong>接入你日常使用的沟通工具。</strong></p>\n<p>这就像给你的AI装上了耳朵和嘴巴，让它能听到你的指令，并能随时向你汇报工作。</p>\n<p>咱们今天就来聊聊如何接入微信和飞书，这两个主流的平台。</p>\n<h2>一、微信：最简单，扫码即用</h2>\n<p>如果你是第一次玩龙虾，我强烈建议你从微信开始。<br>\n腾讯官方直接开放了微信能力给OpenClaw，你只需要用手机微信点击我的-设置 插件，再点击微信 ClawBot 的详情，就弹窗龙虾连接界面了。<br>\n<img src=\"https://static001.geekbang.org/resource/image/20/5c/209206f770a54510dfa514433be0fd5c.png?wh=720x1558\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>按照提示执行<br>\nnpx -y @tencent-weixin/openclaw-weixin-cli@latest install<br>\n之后，就会出现二维码，通过微信扫一扫就能连上了。</p>\n<h2>二、飞书：企业级首选，原生支持</h2>\n<p>如果你是在企业环境里工作，或者希望OpenClaw能深度参与团队协作，那飞书是首选。从OpenClaw 2026.2版本开始，它已经获得了<strong>原生内置支持。</strong></p>\n<p>这意味着你不需要折腾复杂的桥接，直接在OpenClaw的初始化向导里选择飞书，输入创建应用后获取的App ID和App Secret，就能通过WebSocket事件订阅连接起来。 它支持私聊、群聊，还能处理照片、文件、视频等多媒体消息。</p>","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":406520,"user_name":"gq2010","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1044599,"ip_address":"河南","ucode":"E0E09C40BD1E3C","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/f0/77/6c2103b1.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1775122746,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101123301,"comment_content":"老师，录屏没有把屏幕录全，没有看到执行的命令","like_count":6},{"had_liked":false,"id":406526,"user_name":"冰溢","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1650040,"ip_address":"河南","ucode":"ACF256C5F91715","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/19/2d/78/44609a94.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1775142521,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101123301,"comment_content":"老师怎么同时连接飞书的二个机器人","like_count":1},{"had_liked":false,"id":407009,"user_name":"江南烟雨中","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1336475,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"C4D98DFDBF7584","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/14/64/9b/a029ca39.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1776697911,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101123301,"comment_content":"npx -y @tencent-weixin&#47;openclaw-weixin-cli@latest install执行报错：\n-----------------------------------\n[openclaw-weixin] 插件安装失败，请手动执行：\nfetch failed | unable to get local issuer certificate","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":406743,"user_name":"言十年","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1110039,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"67B8B49C3A3B17","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/f0/17/796a3d20.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1775842262,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101123301,"comment_content":"openclaw配置飞书这里不够详细哈","like_count":0}]}